---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="EPA 608 Exam Prep Privacy Policy & Disclaimer - Logicpath Systems">
    <section class="legal-page" style="padding-top: 120px; min-height: 100vh;">
        <div class="container reveal">
            <div class="glass-card" style="padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);">
                <header style="margin-bottom: 3rem; text-align: center;">
                    <h1 class="gradient-text">PRIVACY POLICY</h1>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;"><strong>EPA 608 Exam Prep</strong></p>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary);"><strong>Effective Date:</strong> [06.07.2026]</p>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary);"><strong>Last Updated:</strong> [06.07.2026]</p>
                </header>

                <main class="legal-content">
                    <p>Logicpath Systems ("we," "our," or "us") operates the EPA 608 Exam Prep mobile application (the "App"). This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, and share information when you use our App.</p>
                    
                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>1. INFORMATION WE COLLECT</h2>
                    
                    <h3>1.1 Information You Provide</h3>
                    <p>We do not require you to create an account. We do not collect your name, email address, phone number, or any other personally identifiable information through the App.</p>

                    <h3>1.2 Automatically Collected Information</h3>
                    <p>When you use the App, the following information may be collected automatically:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Device Information:</strong> Device model, operating system version, unique device identifiers, and mobile network information.</li>
                        <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> App interactions, features used, session duration, crash logs, and performance data.</li>
                        <li><strong>Advertising Data:</strong> Advertising ID (Google Advertising ID) provided by your device, which can be reset or opted out of in your device settings.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h3>1.3 Information Collected by Third Parties</h3>
                    <p>The App uses the following third-party services that may collect information:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Google AdMob:</strong> Serves advertisements within the App. AdMob may collect device identifiers, IP address, and usage data to serve personalized or non-personalized ads. See Google's Privacy Policy: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a></li>
                        <li><strong>Google Analytics for Firebase (optional):</strong> May collect app usage analytics to help us improve the App.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>2. HOW WE USE INFORMATION</h2>
                    <p>We use collected information to:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Operate and maintain the App</li>
                        <li>Improve App performance and fix bugs</li>
                        <li>Display advertisements through Google AdMob</li>
                        <li>Analyze usage patterns to improve user experience</li>
                        <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
                    </ul>

                    <p>We do NOT use collected information to:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Identify you personally</li>
                        <li>Sell your data to third parties</li>
                        <li>Send you marketing emails or push notifications (we do not collect your email through the App)</li>
                    </ul>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>3. DATA STORAGE</h2>
                    
                    <h3>3.1 Local Data</h3>
                    <p>All study progress, quiz scores, SM-2 spaced repetition data, streak information, and settings are stored locally on your device using encrypted local storage (Hive). This data never leaves your device and is not transmitted to any server.</p>

                    <h3>3.2 No Account or Cloud Sync</h3>
                    <p>The App does not require or support user accounts. There is no cloud sync. If you uninstall the App, all local study data is permanently deleted.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>4. ADVERTISING</h2>
                    <p>The App displays advertisements served by Google AdMob. You may see personalized ads based on your interests (determined by Google) or non-personalized ads based on contextual information.</p>
                    <p>You can opt out of personalized advertising by:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Adjusting your device's ad settings (Settings > Google > Ads > Opt out of Ads Personalization on Android)</li>
                        <li>Resetting your Advertising ID in device settings</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>For more information on how Google uses your data for advertising, visit: <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a></p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>5. CHILDREN'S PRIVACY</h2>
                    <p>The App is not directed at children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If we become aware that a child under 13 has provided us with personal information, we will take steps to delete such information. If you believe a child under 13 may have provided information through the App, please contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@logicpathsystems.com" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">contact@logicpathsystems.com</a>.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>6. DATA SHARING</h2>
                    <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information. We may share automatically collected, non-personally identifiable information with:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Google AdMob for advertising purposes</li>
                        <li>Google Firebase for analytics purposes (if enabled)</li>
                        <li>Law enforcement if required by law</li>
                    </ul>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>7. DATA RETENTION</h2>
                    <p>Local data (study progress, scores, settings) is stored on your device until you clear App data or uninstall the App.</p>
                    <p>Automatically collected data (crash logs, usage analytics) is retained according to Google's standard retention policies.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>8. YOUR RIGHTS</h2>
                    <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Access, correct, or delete your data</li>
                        <li>Opt out of personalized advertising</li>
                        <li>Request information about data collected</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>Since all study data is stored locally on your device, you have full control over it. You can delete all data by clearing the App's data in your device settings or by uninstalling the App.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>9. SECURITY</h2>
                    <p>We take reasonable measures to protect information collected through the App. Local data is stored using Hive encrypted storage. However, no method of electronic storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>10. CHANGES TO THIS PRIVACY POLICY</h2>
                    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted within the App and on our website. Your continued use of the App after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated Privacy Policy.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>11. CONTACT US</h2>
                    <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us:</p>
                    <p>Logicpath Systems<br/>
                    Email: <a href="mailto:contact@logicpathsystems.com" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">contact@logicpathsystems.com</a><br/>
                    Website: <a href="https://logicpathsystems.com" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://logicpathsystems.com</a></p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>12. CALIFORNIA RESIDENTS (CCPA)</h2>
                    <p>If you are a California resident, you have the right to:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Know what personal information is collected</li>
                        <li>Request deletion of your personal information</li>
                        <li>Opt out of the sale of personal information</li>
                        <li>Not be discriminated against for exercising your rights</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>We do not sell personal information. To exercise your rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@logicpathsystems.com" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">contact@logicpathsystems.com</a>.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>13. EUROPEAN UNION RESIDENTS (GDPR)</h2>
                    <p>If you are located in the European Union, you have rights under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), including the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict processing, and data portability. Our legal basis for processing is legitimate interest (improving the App) and consent (for personalized advertising). To exercise your rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@logicpathsystems.com" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">contact@logicpathsystems.com</a>.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 4rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);" />

                    <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2rem;">DISCLAIMER</h2>
                    <p>EPA 608 Exam Prep is an independent study tool developed and published by Logicpath Systems.</p>
                    
                    <h3>NOT AFFILIATED WITH THE EPA</h3>
                    <p>This app is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or officially connected to the U.S. Environmental Protection Agency (EPA), any EPA-approved testing organization, or any government body.</p>

                    <h3>EDUCATIONAL PURPOSE ONLY</h3>
                    <p>All content in this app — including questions, explanations, flashcards, PT chart data, and statutory calculators — is provided for educational and exam preparation purposes only. This app does not constitute legal, regulatory, or professional advice.</p>

                    <h3>NO GUARANTEE OF EXAM RESULTS</h3>
                    <p>While we strive to provide accurate, current, and comprehensive study material, using this app does not guarantee passage of the EPA Section 608 certification exam. Exam questions are drawn from the EPA's test bank and may differ from the practice questions in this app. Your exam result depends on your individual preparation and the specific test administered.</p>

                    <h3>ACCURACY OF CONTENT</h3>
                    <p>Questions and study material are derived from publicly available EPA publications. Regulations are subject to change. While we make reasonable efforts to keep content current, this app may not reflect the most recent regulatory updates.</p>
                    <p>Always verify current regulations at: <a href="https://www.epa.gov/section608" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://www.epa.gov/section608</a></p>

                    <h3>LIMITATION OF LIABILITY</h3>
                    <p>Logicpath Systems, its developers, and contributors shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from the use of this app, including but not limited to: exam failure, job loss, regulatory penalties, or reliance on potentially outdated information.</p>

                    <h3>USE AT YOUR OWN RISK</h3>
                    <p>By using this app, you acknowledge that you have read and understood this disclaimer and agree to use the app at your own risk.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />
                    
                    <p>For questions or concerns:<br/>
                    Logicpath Systems<br/>
                    Email: <a href="mailto:contact@logicpathsystems.com" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">contact@logicpathsystems.com</a></p>
                </main>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>

<style>
    .legal-content h2 {
        color: var(--text-primary);
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
    
    .legal-content h3 {
        color: var(--text-primary);
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
    }
    
    .legal-content p, .legal-content ul {
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .legal-content ul {
        padding-left: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .legal-content li {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
</style>
